<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kyrgyz April inflation 2.5 pct vs 1.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Kyrgyz April inflation 2.5 pct vs 1.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyrgyzstan's monthly consumer price inflation accelerated in April to 2.5 percent from 1.4 percent in March, the National Statistics Committee said.</p>
<p>    KYRGYZSTAN CONSUMER PRICES  Apr 97    Mar 97    Apr 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	   +2.5	+1.4	+4.6</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	    +30.6     +32.1    + 30.2</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
